//! The compile-time asset table generated by `build.rs`.
//!
//! `ASSETS` is sorted by URL path (the generator iterates a `BTreeMap`), which is
//! what lets [`crate::assets`] resolve a request with a binary search instead of a
//! scan over a few hundred entries. `SHELL_ENTRIES`/`SHELL_ALWAYS` are
//! `embed/shell-map.txt` compiled, so a bad bundle name is a build failure rather
//! than a 404 in the browser.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/embedded.rs"));
